      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The feature was in the patch notes, and it's not difficult to find. Maybe making one of those in-your-face splash screens in the loading screen is needed.\n\nThe increase is usually marginal, yes, but in your average full box or pug it can often claim 10+frames.\n\nMost annoying thing about it is how often I find myself explaining it to people who don't bother reading patch notes or exploring new menu options tbh.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
