      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'd make the same TLDR points. Especially since in practice (not unity benchmarking) it has at least for me 1-5 fps impact in a full loby. I even tested that feature with 10 of these avatars that use up to 1000 collision checks and 300-500 dynamic bones. After 8 avatars it became noticeable. That's a lot more dynamic bones than one would usually see in a public world.\n\nYou could easily up these limits by times 5-10 without causing much trouble.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
